    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c896c68f605f8f8fc27f8f6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜利奖券",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf9b1efecb14e46d153e2ddf7d077e5a0a9e0a4345e01355c5dc33bb97cfb15a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8aa5929ba1afd87d49e7f248",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我是第一名、第一名、第一名────！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3db1363ffc1f46bfb393b0758383b3f2411a15f7542c1ad64cd18919ee50cca9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36213bdd9df4047f3e19b93c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・奖券藏呼声",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d56d93bf8bd29e52672ab213916b72d3cffb1939503e366b778690ddaa53594",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84e9d4a47d63dcf71798d89a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜利奖券是一位情感丰富的赛马娘，\n她在看过“日本德比”后便梦想参赛，\n并成为能“感动”别人的赛马娘──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6e5afca0dbd40aa89f0f912980c5a60d0a3ab5334748221a7367990ce1c425a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d767878fe11576a07f2cd3af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她与竞争对手成田大进、琵琶晨光一起，\n不断进行训练，\n过着互相切磋琢磨的日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d497aaf093e05fecfc186c30d231aa4c991e14da6a91f1904f0cbeb65dd5902c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffd9a571d810305f6a2b00b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我与这样的胜利奖券，\n就此展开以“日本德比”为目标的日子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52fb2a7e6bbee00d29661da11db96e1f56d40e9dbb17d17de3e0fc19f6b309ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24503efbb852db667c7cb41f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜利奖券登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de4871df9af8e6b2d2e4c21dbc0d416622f1cc08d898b90f2c53c06876b9a4ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb4b3b03d1d7f57db2e041ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在研拟准备“日本德比”时，\n为了尽早习惯比较长的距离，\n胜利奖券立下了“希望S”这个目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "986b837c43c6652a7a046149b21294f481b44bfba0d9cf0ae61650841dd86d43",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ca352e79231c3cc9144d898",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可是，即使为了比赛努力练跑，\n纪录却不见起色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51ceb931b8265d54847632945cfd2e19f21c0e838fcfb7764cde3fc934533aee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:822123069ce327af14036554",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样的胜利奖券让琵琶晨光看不下去，\n她提议找成田大进一起，\n三人进行模拟赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b61a29238519e164ee08a3002960a82408b13c42ddf7148d05f0759a1ba9ada",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:768fe35c2df2823eaed978b6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜利奖券在跟她们一起跑过后，\n过去的低潮消失无踪，\n她恢复状态跑出最新个人纪录。",
      "source_fingerprint": "353cdb12f3a8dedac26e9118a74142e7b24835381db4680cf8c664f479f2efa3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1924c060646c6602bf18c8a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这让训练员领悟到，\n“竞争对手”对胜利奖券而言，\n是非常重要的存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd8e866cf88a51263a7770da89f692cc78d0a87cdecc1e80b04df8593452dd81",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a803ef681cb6c8f215d8b88",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两位竞争对手",
      "source_fingerprint": "556fe424b5828b7d59e7ac9b9e161593d94b1cc3134037cd8c42dc9ac1010990",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:315529a56d370c1edffbb23f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "做了在“日本德比”败北的梦后，\n胜利奖券因为太过焦虑，\n而训练过度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d68e78057f65714c447fb38d84733800aa261931cb18570d27364616426c4ef9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:222f00e4bb7c3f1578b5aed2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为此担心的训练员询问之下，\n她才吐露内心不安，\n坦承自己“害怕跑德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a45d097c40d5328ded4bcfd512d4b91b527976889d03237476ece44ddd77f075",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5cd322ab82303b8a441cadf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "透过这次对话，训练员注意到\n她比任何人都渴望胜利，\n于是告诉她，这份强烈的意念会成为武器。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca259c5a62bc4529a277386ccd12f2fae16be2a3153b6483b46ddc21277c5b82",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f0935fb476b22679424233c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜利奖券受到激励后，\n将这份意念化为武器，向夜空喊道：“我绝对\n要在‘日本德比’中获胜。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "68e4db5621c221139f50943b694b3113e723eb9140646da47aeac3b06f128090",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d313f6aaedfbe8933c9c0485",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为想赢，很想赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb9a2ae44313fb72a9f8c6e55350b1c2b0e18f1c4b3bbfbf0d99ef3e712ad3b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8d12eca5b55b40aa21e7f9b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜利奖券为参加“大阪杯”不断训练，\n但是她的努力却未见成效，\n纪录丝毫没有缩短。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13568c7e6f982dc9a2e3e16a4e4c85a39b03dc43e45d12fdacb6542d6b2c6f0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    }
  ]
